  "behavior": [
    "HuC6280 / MSM5205 / CD-DA / Mixer tabs precede the common output monitor. Tab changes never create audio or stop Code/VGM; dedicated MSM/CDDA editors and keyboard instruments remain under construction. Mixer retains the HuC keyboard.",
    "Code reuses existing HuC6280, MSM5205 and CD-DA APIs, one AudioContext, one shared Code FX/fade route and one Master destination. Session retirement aborts pending uploads, retires media worklets and invalidates old clients; Apply keeps raw source IDs, livePrepare values and running track positions.",
    "Media methods are sealed with writable method descriptors so the actual runtime guard can proxy them. Real guardExecution integration reproduces and prevents the former frozen-facade Proxy invariant failure.",
    "Add Code examples to Files installs missing original generated-tone examples only, preserving existing files, selection, Keyboard/Code mode and running sessions. MSM data is bounded 4-bit ADPCM; CDDA uses separate 44.1kHz stereo PCM16 WAV or manifest tracks.",
    "VGM supports a single HuC6280 and optional single MSM5205 (VGM1.72 clock/flags/0x32), including MSM-only. Unsupported declarations remain explained. CDDA is not synthesized from VGM.",
    "Mixer absolute calibrated defaults are HuC6280 .44, MSM5205 1 and CDDA 1; independent 0..3.8 gains and Mute apply before Master. Keyboard, private paused audition, Code and VGM use the same session policy.",
    "Mixed VGM cannot save a false HuC-only checkpoint: paired MSM state is explicitly unavailable and Seek replays from zero. Pure HuC exact state/cache, Pause/Resume, manual editing, held-wave changes and Capture remain covered.",
    "All three actual Code outputs have positive frequency probes, muted sibling negative probes, exact all-muted/Stop silence and shared FX scaling in Chromium and WebKit. VGM mixed PCM, Pause and reconstruction Seek are exercised in the actual standalone ZIP.",
    "ZIP keeps original editable JS/CSS, exactly the three device runtimes, existing pinned native source kits/rebuild recipes and licenses. SDK/WASM binaries and historical calibration reports were not rewritten."
  ],
